    "parts": [],
    "answer_text": "A declining area of land under cultivation coupled with increasing population have many consequences. These are: Food shortage for the rising population; Rise in price of food grains; Unemployment and loss of livelihood for farmers; Shortage of supply of raw material for agro-industries; Adverse effect on export trade as agricultural products comprise a major section of international trade.",
